        "League of Draven will trigger upon receiving an assist on an enemy executed by Death from Below.",
        "When receiving gold from an ally executing a minion through Shared Riches (World Atlas, Runic Compass), Draven is also awarded a Strike stack.\n  - A Strike stack lasts up to 10 seconds or until Draven fails to catch an axe or a nearby minion dies without him killing it. Upon reacing 6 stacks, Draven consumes the stacks to gain 2 stacks of Adoration.\n  - Other sources of gaining Strike stacks were removed in patch V25.06."
